uniform mat4x4 expected -0.94 3.37 1.34 -1.07 0.75999993 0.3 -0.26 -1.3700001 0.43999994 0.99 0.51 -2.31 -0.17000008 -3.19 -1.9300001 1.11
uniform float tolerance 6.302777e-05
